nd lemon lemonade, and vanilla iced latte. Perfect for hot afternoons on our terrace.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"9cb57ea\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9d85ad4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/coffeebar.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/07\\/lateart.webp\",\"id\":1067,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"lateart\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"custom\",\"image_custom_dimension\":{\"width\":\"400\",\"height\":\"400\"},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"space\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":70,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"e3aeba7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Latte Art Workshop in October\",\"header_size\":\"h4\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"c88a1c4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>This month we\'re organizing a small latte art workshop with our barista Damjan. Spots are limited \\u2014 to sign up, ask at the counter or send us a message through the contact form.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"de69f93\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"176a11c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"df683de\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"253fec6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/coffeebar.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/07\\/rodenden.jpg\",\"id\":1068,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"rodenden\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"custom\",\"image_custom_dimension\":{\"width\":\"400\",\"height\":\"400\"},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"space\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":70,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"f933452\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Zrno Turns 3!\",\"header_size\":\"h4\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"a16dce5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Three years have passed since we first opened Zrno\'s doors. What started as a small idea among friends has grown into a place where hundreds of people come every day to find their peace over a cup of coffee. Thank you to every guest who was part of this journey \\u2014 here\'s to many more together.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"1ac8708\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a17321a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/coffeebar.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/07\\/student.jpg\",\"id\":1198,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"student\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"custom\",\"image_custom_dimension\":{\"width\":\"400\",\"height\":\"400\"},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"space\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":70,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"c20509b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Special Offer for Students\",\"header_size\":\"h4\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"ce45107\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Every weekday from 2 to 5 PM, students with a valid student ID get a discount on all hot beverages. The perfect spot to study, meet with classmates, or take a quick break between lectures, with fast WiFi and a quiet atmosphere.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
