nd lemon lemonade, and vanilla iced latte. Perfect for hot afternoons on our terrace.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"f1b57a3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3b62991\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/coffeebar.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/07\\/lateart.webp\",\"id\":1067,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"lateart\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"custom\",\"image_custom_dimension\":{\"width\":\"400\",\"height\":\"400\"},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"space\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":70,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"a49418c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Latte Art Workshop in October\",\"header_size\":\"h4\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"e5becd5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>This month we\'re organizing a small latte art workshop with our barista Damjan. Spots are limited \\u2014 to sign up, ask at the counter or send us a message through the contact form.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"7ee8271\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"73095d4\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"638729e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/coffeebar.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/07\\/rodenden.jpg\",\"id\":1068,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"rodenden\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"custom\",\"image_custom_dimension\":{\"width\":\"400\",\"height\":\"400\"},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"space\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":70,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"5445c0c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Zrno Turns 3!\",\"header_size\":\"h4\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"3ee8892\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Three years have passed since we first opened Zrno\'s doors. What started as a small idea among friends has grown into a place where hundreds of people come every day to find their peace over a cup of coffee. Thank you to every guest who was part of this journey \\u2014 here\'s to many more together.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"0667dbb\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"33126fd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/coffeebar.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/07\\/student.jpg\",\"id\":1198,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"student\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"custom\",\"image_custom_dimension\":{\"width\":\"400\",\"height\":\"400\"},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"space\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":70,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"01cfc4e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Special Offer for Students\",\"header_size\":\"h4\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"db8151c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Every weekday from 2 to 5 PM, students with a valid student ID get a discount on all hot beverages. The perfect spot to study, meet with classmates, or take a quick break between lectures, with fast WiFi and a quiet atmosphere.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
