(942,	1,	'2026-07-21 09:41:32',	'2026-07-21 07:41:32',	'<h2>Добредојдовте во Зрно</h2>				\n		<p>Топло катче во срцето на градот, каде секое утро мириса на свежо кафе.</p>		\n								<figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich1-rqq8jbtlzw6399xlmwmzfkat1hfwlwepkm35dlp6vc.webp\" alt=\"kafich1\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich2-rqq8jdpadk8nwhuvbxg8kjtq896n1am68ve4c5meiw.jpg\" alt=\"kafich2\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich3-rqq8jen4ke9y83ti6fuv51l6tn208zpwl01ltfl0co.webp\" alt=\"kafich3\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich4-rqq8jgisy2civbqrvgo4a1440esqodxd99ckrzi808.jpg\" alt=\"kafich4\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich5-rqq8jhgn4wdt6xpepz2quivklso3w313le0299gtu0.jpg\" alt=\"kafich5\" /></figure>			\n			 години врвна услуга			\n				0\n				+\n			видови пијалоци			\n				0\n			гости			\n				0\n				+',	'Почетна',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'%d0%bf%d0%be%d1%87%d0%b5%d1%82%d0%bd%d0%b0',	'',	'',	'2026-07-24 12:15:55',	'2026-07-24 10:15:55',	'',	0,	'http://coffeebar.local/?page_id=942',	0,	'page',	'',	0),
