(1095,	1,	'2026-07-22 22:02:04',	'2026-07-22 20:02:04',	'<h2>Welcome to Zrno</h2>				\n		<p>A warm corner in the heart of the city, where every morning smells of fresh coffee.</p>		\n								<figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich1-rqq8jbtlzw6399xlmwmzfkat1hfwlwepkm35dlp6vc.webp\" alt=\"kafich1\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich2-rqq8jdpadk8nwhuvbxg8kjtq896n1am68ve4c5meiw.jpg\" alt=\"kafich2\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich3-rqq8jen4ke9y83ti6fuv51l6tn208zpwl01ltfl0co.webp\" alt=\"kafich3\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich4-rqq8jgisy2civbqrvgo4a1440esqodxd99ckrzi808.jpg\" alt=\"kafich4\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich5-rqq8jhgn4wdt6xpepz2quivklso3w313le0299gtu0.jpg\" alt=\"kafich5\" /></figure>			\n			years in business			\n				0\n				+\n			types of drinks			\n				0\n			happy guests			\n				0\n				+',	'Почетна - English',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'1088-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-07-22 22:02:04',	'2026-07-22 20:02:04',	'',	1088,	'http://coffeebar.local/?p=1095',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
(1096,	1,	'2026-07-22 22:02:46',	'2026-07-22 20:02:46',	'<h2>About Us</h2>				\n		<p>Zrno started as an idea among friends who wanted to create a place where the smell of freshly ground coffee would be the first thing to welcome you in the morning. Every bean we use goes through a carefully selected roasting process, to preserve the flavor and character that makes it special. We believe good coffee isn\'t just a drink — it\'s a moment of pause in the day, a space where you can meet a friend or simply reflect in silence.</p><p> </p>		\n					<h5><strong>Damjan Ristovski — founder and barista</strong></h5>				\n		<p>Damjan worked for ten years in hospitality across Skopje,  but always felt something was missing — a place that would be truly \'his own.\' His travels through Italy and Vienna taught him how much coffee can be more than a habit — it\'s a ritual. Building on that experience, he decided to open a space where every guest would feel warmth and attention to detail, exactly what was missing in many of the cafés he had passed through.</p>		\n																<a href=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/barista.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"barista\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6OTUyLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9jb2ZmZWViYXIubG9jYWxcL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjZcLzA3XC9iYXJpc3RhLmpwZyJ9\">\n							<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/barista-rqq3t8wxz0q822e6tt2k1ywdtamnigtghy1xbdut8o.jpg\" title=\"barista\" alt=\"barista\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/girl-rqq413ud45hj4oz7xpd9ehi4m9w4vd0nwuf2ro7b7s.webp\" title=\"girl\" alt=\"girl\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h5><strong>Ivana Todorovska — atmosphere and design</strong></h5>				\n		<p>Ivana studied architecture, and her passion for spaces that \'breathe\' led her to shape the interior of Zrno. She loves places where people stay longer not because they have to, but because they want to. Every corner of the café — from the choice of lighting to the furniture — is her vision for a space that invites people to make it their own second corner for work, conversation, or silence.</p>',	'About Us',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'for-us',	'',	'',	'2026-07-22 22:06:30',	'2026-07-22 20:06:30',	'',	0,	'http://coffeebar.local/?page_id=1096',	0,	'page',	'',	0),
