he interior of Zrno. She loves places where people stay longer not because they have to, but because they want to. Every corner of the café — from the choice of lighting to the furniture — is her vision for a space that invites people to make it their own second corner for work, conversation, or silence.</p>',	'For us',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'1096-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-07-22 22:05:47',	'2026-07-22 20:05:47',	'',	1096,	'http://coffeebar.local/?p=1100',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
