(1102,	1,	'2026-07-22 22:07:01',	'2026-07-22 20:07:01',	'<h2>Welcome to Zrno</h2>				\n		<p>A warm corner in the heart of the city, where every morning smells of fresh coffee.</p>		\n								<figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich1-rqq8jbtlzw6399xlmwmzfkat1hfwlwepkm35dlp6vc.webp\" alt=\"kafich1\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich2-rqq8jdpadk8nwhuvbxg8kjtq896n1am68ve4c5meiw.jpg\" alt=\"kafich2\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich3-rqq8jen4ke9y83ti6fuv51l6tn208zpwl01ltfl0co.webp\" alt=\"kafich3\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich4-rqq8jgisy2civbqrvgo4a1440esqodxd99ckrzi808.jpg\" alt=\"kafich4\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/kafich5-rqq8jhgn4wdt6xpepz2quivklso3w313le0299gtu0.jpg\" alt=\"kafich5\" /></figure>			\n			years in business			\n				0\n				+\n			types of drinks			\n				0\n			happy guests			\n				0\n				+',	'Home',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'1088-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-07-22 22:07:01',	'2026-07-22 20:07:01',	'',	1088,	'http://coffeebar.local/?p=1102',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
(1103,	1,	'2026-07-22 22:07:17',	'2026-07-22 20:07:17',	'<h2>Искуствата на нашите верни гости</h2>				\n				0\n				% задоволни гости\n		<p><strong>Елена Т.</strong> ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br />\"Совршено место за работа од далечина — брз WiFi, тивка атмосфера и одлично кафе. Препорачувам!\"</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/z2-rqqlbtx2f4dbkk48u1z226oybc5110rfrgf6a7xcxk.jpg\" title=\"z2\" alt=\"z2\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><strong>Никола П.</strong> ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br />\"Дојдов еднаш случајно и оттогаш сум редовен гостин. Персоналот те памети по име, а тоа значи многу.\"</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/m1-rqqlaxyjyr5klteo0o5qpera48ijrb8kb28nyt8qt4.jpg\" title=\"screenshot\" alt=\"screenshot\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><strong>Марија С.</strong> ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br />\"Секое утро поминувам низ Зрно пред работа — атмосферата е неверојатна, а капучиното е најдоброто во градот.\"</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/z1-rqqla7n2ne5jkqgwacs6rledhg49rsc2vfz2j2brnc.jpg\" title=\"z1\" alt=\"z1\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><strong>Александар Ѓ.</strong> ⭐⭐⭐⭐<br />\"Фредо еспресото е одличено, а цените се фер за квалитетот. Единствено понекогаш е попрометно во попладневните часови.\"</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/m2-rqqlc9wbnaz71xh18qvpqknsevy9nvivhniffx9nzs.jpg\" title=\"m2\" alt=\"m2\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><strong>Ивона М.</strong> <img role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/svg/2b50.svg\" alt=\"⭐\" /><img role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/svg/2b50.svg\" alt=\"⭐\" /><img role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/svg/2b50.svg\" alt=\"⭐\" /><img role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/svg/2b50.svg\" alt=\"⭐\" /><img role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/svg/2b50.svg\" alt=\"⭐\" /><br />\"Најдобрата лате уметност во Скопје! Секогаш се враќам за истата шолја топлина и мир. </p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/z3-rqqlcrr995nn6ir3cglmjy5jp7i8q4hrw3wnk6j6pk.webp\" title=\"z3\" alt=\"z3\" loading=\"lazy\" />',	'Искуства',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'975-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-07-22 22:07:17',	'2026-07-22 20:07:17',	'',	975,	'http://coffeebar.local/?p=1103',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
(1104,	1,	'2026-07-22 22:07:44',	'2026-07-22 20:07:44',	'<h2>What Our Loyal Guests Say</h2>				\n				0\n				% happy guests\n		<p><strong>Elena T.</strong> ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br />\"The perfect spot to work remotely — fast WiFi, quiet atmosphere, and great coffee. Highly recommend!\"</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/z2-rqqlbtx2f4dbkk48u1z226oybc5110rfrgf6a7xcxk.jpg\" title=\"z2\" alt=\"z2\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><b>Nikola P. </b> ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br />\"I walked in once by chance and I\'ve been a regular ever since. The staff remember you by name, and that means a lot.\"</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/m1-rqqlaxyjyr5klteo0o5qpera48ijrb8kb28nyt8qt4.jpg\" title=\"screenshot\" alt=\"screenshot\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><strong>Marija S.</strong> ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br />\"Every morning I stop by Zrno before work — the atmosphere is incredible, and the cappuccino is the best in town.\"</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/z1-rqqla7n2ne5jkqgwacs6rledhg49rsc2vfz2j2brnc.jpg\" title=\"z1\" alt=\"z1\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><b>Aleksandar G.</b> ⭐⭐⭐⭐<br />\"The fredo espresso is amazing, and the prices are fair for the quality. Just gets a bit crowded in the afternoons.\"</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/m2-rqqlc9wbnaz71xh18qvpqknsevy9nvivhniffx9nzs.jpg\" title=\"m2\" alt=\"m2\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><strong>Ivona M.</strong> <img role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/svg/2b50.svg\" alt=\"⭐\" /><img role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/svg/2b50.svg\" alt=\"⭐\" /><img role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/svg/2b50.svg\" alt=\"⭐\" /><img role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/svg/2b50.svg\" alt=\"⭐\" /><img role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/svg/2b50.svg\" alt=\"⭐\" /><br />\"The best latte art in Skopje! I always come back for the same cup of warmth and calm.\"</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/z3-rqqlcrr995nn6ir3cglmjy5jp7i8q4hrw3wnk6j6pk.webp\" title=\"z3\" alt=\"z3\" loading=\"lazy\" />',	'Experiences',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'experiences',	'',	'',	'2026-10-05 21:51:01',	'2026-10-05 19:51:01',	'',	0,	'http://coffeebar.local/?page_id=1104',	0,	'page',	'',	0),
