(1122,	1,	'2026-07-22 22:33:01',	'2026-07-22 20:33:01',	'<h2>Our Menu</h2>				\n		<p>Every drink is prepared with care, from bean selection to serving.</p>		\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2590\" open>\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2590\" >\n					 Coffee \n						</summary>\n									<p>Espresso — 110 den.<br />Macchiato — 130 den.<br />Cappuccino — 130 den.<br />Fredo Espresso — 170 den.<br />Fredo Cappuccino — 190 den.<br />Coffee Latte — 190 den.<br />Instant Coffee — 130 den.<br />Flavored Instant Coffee — 140 den.</p>								\n					</details>\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2591\" >\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2591\" >\n					 Coffee to Go \n						</summary>\n									<p>Espresso — 100 den.<br />Macchiato — 120 den.<br />Cappuccino — 110 den.<br />Iced Espresso — 160 den.<br />Iced Cappuccino — 180 den.<br />Coffee Latte — 120 den.<br />Instant Coffee — 110 den.</p>								\n					</details>\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2592\" >\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2592\" >\n					 Hot Drinks \n						</summary>\n									<p>Hot Chocolate — 160 den.<br />Salep — 160 den.<br />Tea — 130 den.<br />Cocoa — 160 den.</p>								\n					</details>\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2593\" >\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2593\" >\n					 Soft Drinks \n						</summary>\n									<p>Coca-Cola / Zero — 130 den.<br />Red Bull — 240 den.<br />Sprite — 130 den.<br />Fanta — 130 den.<br />Schweppes (Bitter Lemon/Tangerine/Tonic) — 130 den.<br />Fresh Orange/Lemon/Grapefruit — 210 den.<br />Fresh Pineapple Juice — 300 den.<br />Fresh Apple Juice — 180 den.<br />Aloe Vera — 200 den.<br />Dr. Burn — 300 den.</p>								\n					</details>\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2594\" >\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"5\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2594\" >\n					 Water \n						</summary>\n									<p>Rosa (still/sparkling) — 110 den.<br />Knjaz Milos sparkling — 110 den.<br />Gorska still — 100 den.<br />Gorska sparkling — 110 den.</p>								\n					</details>\n		<p>Espresso — 110 den.<br />Macchiato — 130 den.<br />Cappuccino — 130 den.<br />Fredo Espresso — 170 den.<br />Fredo Cappuccino — 190 den.<br />Coffee Latte — 190 den.<br />Instant Coffee — 130 den.<br />Flavored Instant Coffee — 140 den.</p><p>Espresso — 100 den.<br />Macchiato — 120 den.<br />Cappuccino — 110 den.<br />Iced Espresso — 160 den.<br />Iced Cappuccino — 180 den.<br />Coffee Latte — 120 den.<br />Instant Coffee — 110 den.</p><p>Hot Chocolate — 160 den.<br />Salep — 160 den.<br />Tea — 130 den.<br />Cocoa — 160 den.</p><p>Coca-Cola / Zero — 130 den.<br />Red Bull — 240 den.<br />Sprite — 130 den.<br />Fanta — 130 den.<br />Schweppes (Bitter Lemon/Tangerine/Tonic) — 130 den.<br />Fresh Orange/Lemon/Grapefruit — 210 den.<br />Fresh Pineapple Juice — 300 den.<br />Fresh Apple Juice — 180 den.<br />Aloe Vera — 200 den.<br />Dr. Burn — 300 den.</p><p>Rosa (still/sparkling) — 110 den.<br />Knjaz Milos sparkling — 110 den.<br />Gorska still — 100 den.<br />Gorska sparkling — 110 den.</p>',	'Menu',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'1118-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-07-22 22:33:01',	'2026-07-22 20:33:01',	'',	1118,	'http://coffeebar.local/?p=1122',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
(1123,	1,	'2026-07-22 22:37:12',	'2026-07-22 20:37:12',	'<h2>Blog &amp; News</h2>				\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/novo-meni-rqs6pcdlouovn0063soxb1fse3pa4nx2yl7h0zujz4.jpg\" title=\"novo meni\" alt=\"novo meni\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>New Summer Menu</h4>				\n		<p>With summer here, refreshing new combinations are arriving at Zrno. We\'re introducing several new cold specialties — hazelnut frappé, fresh mint and lemon lemonade, and vanilla iced latte. Perfect for hot afternoons on our terrace.</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/lateart-rqs6q99yc1xwxcodrowv8b4x6l74m2jor41gtohrxc.webp\" title=\"lateart\" alt=\"lateart\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Latte Art Workshop in October</h4>				\n		<p>This month we\'re organizing a small latte art workshop with our barista Damjan. Spots are limited — to sign up, ask at the counter or send us a message through the contact form.</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/rodenden-rqs6r7456388jbb8a3jfq2likgkcb6a0vriy3n3lpc.jpg\" title=\"rodenden\" alt=\"rodenden\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Zrno Turns 3!</h4>				\n		<p>Three years have passed since we first opened Zrno\'s doors. What started as a small idea among friends has grown into a place where hundreds of people come every day to find their peace over a cup of coffee. Thank you to every guest who was part of this journey — here\'s to many more together.</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/student-rqyq7xb69f89yye457kspzzaw7uq24asbo5oa6kko0.jpg\" title=\"student\" alt=\"student\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Special Offer for Students</h4>				\n		<p>Every weekday from 2 to 5 PM, students with a valid student ID get a discount on all hot beverages. The perfect spot to study, meet with classmates, or take a quick break between lectures, with fast WiFi and a quiet atmosphere.</p>',	'Events',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'events',	'',	'',	'2026-07-26 09:16:18',	'2026-07-26 07:16:18',	'',	0,	'http://coffeebar.local/?page_id=1123',	0,	'page',	'',	0),
