(1211,	1,	'2026-07-26 09:16:18',	'2026-07-26 07:16:18',	'<h2>Blog &amp; News</h2>				\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/novo-meni-rqs6pcdlouovn0063soxb1fse3pa4nx2yl7h0zujz4.jpg\" title=\"novo meni\" alt=\"novo meni\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>New Summer Menu</h4>				\n		<p>With summer here, refreshing new combinations are arriving at Zrno. We\'re introducing several new cold specialties — hazelnut frappé, fresh mint and lemon lemonade, and vanilla iced latte. Perfect for hot afternoons on our terrace.</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/lateart-rqs6q99yc1xwxcodrowv8b4x6l74m2jor41gtohrxc.webp\" title=\"lateart\" alt=\"lateart\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Latte Art Workshop in October</h4>				\n		<p>This month we\'re organizing a small latte art workshop with our barista Damjan. Spots are limited — to sign up, ask at the counter or send us a message through the contact form.</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/rodenden-rqs6r7456388jbb8a3jfq2likgkcb6a0vriy3n3lpc.jpg\" title=\"rodenden\" alt=\"rodenden\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Zrno Turns 3!</h4>				\n		<p>Three years have passed since we first opened Zrno\'s doors. What started as a small idea among friends has grown into a place where hundreds of people come every day to find their peace over a cup of coffee. Thank you to every guest who was part of this journey — here\'s to many more together.</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://coffeebar.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/student-rqyq7xb69f89yye457kspzzaw7uq24asbo5oa6kko0.jpg\" title=\"student\" alt=\"student\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Special Offer for Students</h4>				\n		<p>Every weekday from 2 to 5 PM, students with a valid student ID get a discount on all hot beverages. The perfect spot to study, meet with classmates, or take a quick break between lectures, with fast WiFi and a quiet atmosphere.</p>',	'Events',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'1123-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-07-26 09:16:18',	'2026-07-26 07:16:18',	'',	1123,	'http://coffeebar.local/?p=1211',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
